Package: libexempi8
Version: @DEB_EXEMPI_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://libopenraw.freedesktop.org/exempi/
Description: library to parse XMP metadata - runtime
 Exempi is a port of Adobe's XMP SDK to work on UNIX. It parses and manipulates
 the XMP metadata embedded in files (e.g. PDFs). This package contains the shared
 library, used by the Papers GTK4 document viewer.
